# Build context is the repository root for the TypeScript services
# (npm workspaces). Keep host artifacts out of the images: node_modules built
# on the host (Windows/macOS binaries of librdkafka) must never be copied.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.idea
.vscode
.claude
openspec
docs
experiments
**/target
